{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n任天堂「PIKMIN：皮克敏秋季收穫祭」由即日起至 11 月 22 日於朗豪坊舉辦。4樓化身田園秋日花園，設有皮克敏搬運南瓜果實及《皮克敏 4 Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + 大家來挑戰! 當多慮檢定》主題打卡位與試玩；同場限定商品販賣區更雲集逾百款毛公仔、掛飾、文具及遊戲新作！12樓「Nintendo Today!」體驗區，入場即可免費領取皮克敏紙帽，完成簽到及問卷更可獲贈角色卡及兩款限定透明卡；手遊《Pikmin Bloom》玩家到訪「特殊地點」完成任務，還可獲得限定金色花苗及明信片！\n</p>\n<p>「PIKMIN：皮克敏秋季收穫祭」活動詳情<br/>\n日期：2026年11月10日（二）至2026年11月22日（日）<br/>\n時間：星期一至五 10:30 – 21:30／星期六及日 10:30 – 22:00<br/>\n地點：朗豪坊4樓通天廣場及12樓</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179467202655140311_11001264166af8859aeb290.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179467202655140311_11001264166af8859aeb290.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179467202820972259_17759901076af8859c97367.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179467202820972259_17759901076af8859c97367.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179467203010572137_4328350796af8859e9cbf1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179467203010572137_4328350796af8859e9cbf1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179467203210726382_11059607086af885a09489b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179467203210726382_11059607086af885a09489b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179467203436268930_20530334636af885a2c7388.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179467203436268930_20530334636af885a2c7388.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfuXtv8DA5J/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T16:27:30.878919+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":493,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T16:00:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T16:41:14.439569+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T16:20:59.876914+00:00","content_hash":"4522cdbf46d5c3e15a45cf86efb87b2e4cf03963693e5494bdbe2fa8501cdd66","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}